        "title": "Chat blocks sending when a remote agent is offline",
        "summary": "The agent chat panel now reflects live remote-agent status, disabling send and dimming unavailable agents in the mention menu before a message goes out.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "AgentChatPanel subscribes to the profile status store, registers the current remote agent for live updates, and disables send with a clear \"This remote agent is offline. Start it before sending a message.\" reason when the agent is stopped.",
            "commit_shas": [
